; Opaque is about the contents, not the slot. `:body` is typed `form`,
; and that check runs before anything is or is not descended into.
;
;   wrong_underlying at [template body]
;   form `template` keyword `:body` expects form, got number
;
; The boundary is the whole contract: the schema says what shape the
; slot takes and says nothing about what is inside that shape.
;
;   cat examples/plugins/opaque-slot/plugin.sjon \
;       examples/plugins/opaque-slot/example-boundary.sjon | sjon validate - --no-project

(template :name broken :body 3)
